      "NO_SUM_SPAN": "remove combo.sum_span_match (sum/span)"
    },
    "weight_handling_rule": "ZERO-then-normalize: set removed feature's production weight key to 0.0, keep all other weights unchanged; scorer._normalize_weights renormalizes remaining to sum=1 (production builtin behavior). NO post-hoc weight retuning. Rule frozen in definition BEFORE results."
